Z||000004||87GTZ34||10-06-2000||11:55 AM||||I paid $1100 for mine w/ all sensors & engine wiring (not underhood harness)and warranty.  I asked for VIN for eng & trans to verify miles, location etc.  Eng had 52K on it and trans had 54K. Both were from a '96 Z34 MC (but two diff cars).  As mentioned in the forum (many, many times) wiring is drastically different for the 2 engs & on top of that I went to '96 OBD II.<BR>BTW, I have many 2.8 parts left over, cruise cntl, intake, exhaust, wires sensors etc.<P>------------------<BR>87GTZ34||||reg||1
Z||000005||lowCG||10-07-2000||11:21 AM||||Mine('97)set me back $1500,had 33K, came with the computer,power steering pump,and underhood harness(needed)from Schram Auto Parts in Waterford MI.<p>[This message has been edited by lowCG (edited 10-07-2000).]||||reg||1
